      "updated": 1764611087304,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1) Functional Requirements:  \n- User should be able to create posts\n- User should be able to follow other users\n- Users should be able to view a feed of posts from people they follow,\nin chronological order.\n- Users should be able to page through their feed.\n\n---- out of scope ------\n- User should be able to like and comment on posts \n- posts can be prove or have restricted visibility \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1) Functional Requirements:  \n- User should be able to create posts\n- User should be able to follow other users\n- Users should be able to view a feed of posts from people they follow, in chronological order.\n- Users should be able to page through their feed.\n\n---- out of scope ------\n- User should be able to like and comment on posts \n- posts can be prove or have restricted visibility \n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
