    {
      "id": "_ywwz_CtZIWSp99dU_mD4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 616.7233228523977,
      "y": 368.13396598170425,
      "width": 722.897812590283,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#eebefa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6o",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1423259250,
      "version": 579,
      "versionNonce": 566022574,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1764611502033,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2) Non Functional Requirements:  \n- Scalability: system should be able to handle massive number of\nusers(2B)\n- Performance: low latency in terms of feed generation(<500ms near real\ntime)\n- Availability: System should be highly available \n- Consistency: since we are prioritising availability hence eventual\nconsistency works here in terms of the feed generation with the latest\ndata. \n\n3) Core Entities \n- User \n- Post \n- Feed \n- Follow ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2) Non Functional Requirements:  \n- Scalability: system should be able to handle massive number of users(2B)\n- Performance: low latency in terms of feed generation(<500ms near real time)\n- Availability: System should be highly available \n- Consistency: since we are prioritising availability hence eventual consistency works here in terms of the feed generation with the latest data. \n\n3) Core Entities \n- User \n- Post \n- Feed \n- Follow ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wRXJSJmciRq4pmvEhSAe5",
